    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u201cOn the day of what she believed to be her \u2018Happy ending\u2019, Cinderella witnesses the collapse of her universe and the murder of her beloved. With the help of a magic grimoire, in search of the truth, she walks into various fairy tales, through worlds that are now disturbing and enigmatic. Fighting enemies corrupted by a strange curse, the princess becomes a mighty warrior, determined to resolve this chaos.\u201d</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u201cOn the day of what she believed to be her \u2018Happy ending\u2019, Cinderella witnesses the collapse of her universe and the murder of her beloved. With the help of a magic grimoire, in search of the truth, she walks into various fairy tales, through worlds that are now disturbing and enigmatic. Fighting enemies corrupted by a strange curse, the princess becomes a mighty warrior, determined to resolve this chaos.\u201d</p>",
    "short_description": "A dark fantasy adventure in Cinderella Chronicles. Use magic and wield a bloodthirsty shoe sword to battle corrupted enemies, transcend into badass mode, and solve puzzles with sidekicks. Unravel the truth behind a mysterious curse and embark on an epic journey to save the tales from darkness !",
